<title>USA: Nordson says CEO to change posts Oct. 31.</title>
<headline>Nordson says CEO to change posts Oct. 31.</headline>
<dateline>WESTLAKE, Ohio 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nordson Corp said on Tuesday William Madar, vice chairman and chief executive officer, will relinquish those posts and become nonexecutive chairman at the end of the fiscal year October 31.</p>
<p>Edward Campbell will become chief executive and retain the position of president of the maker of adhesives and sealants, Nordson said.</p>
<p>On October 31, Madar will replace Eric Nord, who served as chairman for the past 30 years and will continue as director, Nordson said.</p>
